  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">River Redux 是一款适用于 Fabric 和 Forge 的模组，它改进了原版河流的地形生成，并添加了 3 种新的河流生物群系以增加多样性！目前它添加了沙质河流、砾石河流和热带河流。未来还计划添加更多河流生物群系。River Redux 需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrablender</a>。在服务器上运行时，仅需服务器端安装该模组即可。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Discord 服务器</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/EwQmvQtshV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/EwQmvQtshV</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">加入 Discord 以获取关于未来更新的资讯、讨论模组内容以及分享截图！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">图片</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙质河流：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/817769622392012812/1005518542457819236/unknown.png?width=1189&height=630\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"774\" height=\"410\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">砾石河流：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/817769622392012812/1005518558719123508/unknown.png?width=1189&height=630\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"772\" height=\"409\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">热带河流：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/817769622392012812/1005518503845044425/unknown.png?width=1189&height=630\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"772\" height=\"409\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
